WEBVTT

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:15.682
<i>We'll be all right.</i>

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:21.604
There must be a paradise
waiting for us, somewhere.

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:24.024
Just give up!

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:27.819
There isn't a place where
you can live together. It doesn't exist.

00:00:27.902 --> 00:00:29.696
No. No!

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.365
-Arya!
-Give up! You can't live with humans.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.534
You're a vampire!

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.123
I'm sorry.

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:44.044
-This was impossible…
-For us.

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.047
Help me.

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:54.888
No. You can't leave. Arya!

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:00.852
The paradise we've been searching for
is not that far away.

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:02.979
-There's no place like--
-It exists.

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.564
I have to go now.

00:01:06.816 --> 00:01:07.984
Momo!

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:28.963
It's her.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.210
Momo, are you all right?

00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:10.421
You came for me.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.842
This thing you gave me,
it really came in handy.

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:19.889
I'm sorry, Momo. I'm glad you're okay.
It was foolish of me.

00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:21.808
It's okay.

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:26.729
Allegro.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.191
Momo! Get away from that vampire.

00:02:30.275 --> 00:02:32.277
-Mama…
-Grab on.

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.784
All right. Let's go.

00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:50.044
Fine, stop being reckless.

00:02:50.545 --> 00:02:51.462
Crap.

00:03:00.096 --> 00:03:01.598
Capture the queen.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:03.474
Take her someplace safe.

00:03:11.441 --> 00:03:12.984
This is incredible.

00:03:13.067 --> 00:03:14.986
Stop giving them free rein.

00:03:15.069 --> 00:03:17.655
See, I told you they'd get in the way.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.451
You're in my way.

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:36.424
Crap.

00:03:38.176 --> 00:03:40.970
Listen carefully, Momo.
Make sure to hold on tight.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:51.189
Go. Go around and cut them off.

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:05.912
Fine.

00:04:06.454 --> 00:04:09.958
I'm begging you.
Stop pushing yourself so hard.

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:13.795
I don't want to see you get hurt anymore.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:15.588
Thank you, Momo.

00:04:16.172 --> 00:04:17.715
I'll be all right.

00:04:18.383 --> 00:04:22.262
We first need to gain some distance
and find a place to regroup.

00:04:31.479 --> 00:04:33.898
Fine!

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:53.710
Stay away from Fine.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.628
Momo, don't!

00:05:05.596 --> 00:05:06.806
Let go of me!

00:05:13.938 --> 00:05:14.897
Crap!

00:05:27.952 --> 00:05:29.245
Be sure not to hit the girl.

00:05:30.079 --> 00:05:31.080
Crap.

00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:35.793
Good. We've got them cornered.

00:05:35.877 --> 00:05:38.629
Send updates to Boss.
We almost have her cornered.

00:05:57.607 --> 00:05:58.983
We have to go, Momo.

00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:03.071
They've caught up to us.

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:06.657
Wait. What are you planning to do?

00:06:06.741 --> 00:06:07.950
No, don't!

00:06:09.619 --> 00:06:10.703
Fine!

00:06:11.287 --> 00:06:13.790
Follow the canal and head outside.

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:16.209
Get outside of this factory.
I'll meet up with you.

00:06:16.793 --> 00:06:18.795
I'll stay here till you get out.

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:22.423
I'll make sure they stay here till then.

00:06:27.762 --> 00:06:29.597
You're going to leave me again?

00:06:30.098 --> 00:06:31.474
I don't want you to.

00:06:32.016 --> 00:06:33.559
I'll fight too.

00:06:34.393 --> 00:06:36.145
If this is it, let's die together.

00:06:36.229 --> 00:06:37.396
Let's make a promise.

00:06:37.939 --> 00:06:41.192
We'll get out of here
and create a paradise of our own.

00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:44.153
Someplace no one else knows about.

00:06:44.862 --> 00:06:46.656
For now, you have to go alone.

00:06:50.159 --> 00:06:53.079
It can't be.
You aren't able to stop the bleeding.

00:06:55.832 --> 00:06:57.125
Fine, no!

00:07:00.044 --> 00:07:02.421
Fine? Fine!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.238
Fine?

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:30.116
Fine!

00:07:44.589 --> 00:07:45.965
I have to get back there.

00:07:58.853 --> 00:08:00.021
I found you.

00:08:03.065 --> 00:08:05.485
You're an angel of death. Where is Fine?

00:08:05.568 --> 00:08:07.653
Fine used that drug.

00:08:07.737 --> 00:08:09.489
To turn into a beast.

00:08:10.698 --> 00:08:13.618
Why?

00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:23.628
The commander's daughter, I've got you!

00:08:23.711 --> 00:08:24.587
Momo!

00:08:26.797 --> 00:08:28.382
Let her go! Now!

00:08:28.466 --> 00:08:30.843
I can't do that. I'm taking her back.

00:08:30.927 --> 00:08:32.220
In return, I'll get--

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:37.099
Don't get in my way.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.770
-Apprehend him.
-Yes.

00:08:41.646 --> 00:08:43.940
Hope there's no hard feelings.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:48.611
This is all for the advancement
of science and humankind.

00:08:53.616 --> 00:08:54.534
Crap.

00:08:55.576 --> 00:08:58.538
I should've stopped you long ago.

00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:01.582
I should have killed you…

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.295
when I had the chance.

00:09:09.382 --> 00:09:11.884
Go find Fine.

00:09:13.261 --> 00:09:14.470
Save her.

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:25.189
We're going home, Momo.

00:09:25.273 --> 00:09:27.191
It's not too late. I can help--

00:09:27.275 --> 00:09:29.986
-Let go!
-Don't go, Momo!

00:09:39.078 --> 00:09:40.037
I'm sorry.

00:09:45.001 --> 00:09:46.085
<i>I promised that…</i>

00:09:47.378 --> 00:09:48.838
<i>I would protect you.</i>

00:09:52.633 --> 00:09:53.759
<i>Back then…</i>

00:09:56.053 --> 00:09:58.222
<i>If only I were stronger.</i>

00:10:00.558 --> 00:10:02.977
I never should've left you alone.

00:10:24.999 --> 00:10:26.959
Boss, be careful.

00:10:28.336 --> 00:10:30.630
You'll have to take it from here.

00:10:38.429 --> 00:10:41.057
I'm delighted to see you
in your true form.

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:42.266
You monster.

00:10:50.858 --> 00:10:53.819
Come at me.
You want this blood, don't you?

00:11:30.439 --> 00:11:31.315
Fine!

00:11:32.024 --> 00:11:34.026
Fine, don't give up.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:36.529
Can you tell? It's me.

00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:39.115
Momo, get away from her.

00:11:39.824 --> 00:11:42.118
That thing can't recognize you anymore.

00:12:00.803 --> 00:12:03.556
This is the natural outcome
of a human-vampire relationship.

00:12:03.639 --> 00:12:06.517
-Shut up!
-You've seen it with your own eyes.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:09.854
This paradise is all a sham.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.275
Why won't you leave us alone?

00:12:14.358 --> 00:12:16.902
Because I care about you. Let her go.

00:12:16.986 --> 00:12:20.948
There is no paradise
where the two of you can live together.

00:12:29.206 --> 00:12:32.334
-No. No!
-Arya!

00:12:32.418 --> 00:12:36.255
I'm sorry. This was an impossible plan.

00:12:37.006 --> 00:12:39.467
<i>This paradise doesn't exist anywhere.</i>

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:42.678
Don't tell me what is and isn't possible.

00:12:43.846 --> 00:12:46.140
I don't expect you to understand.

00:12:46.223 --> 00:12:49.226
About Fine, or about us!

00:12:52.813 --> 00:12:54.690
And what do you think you know?

00:12:54.773 --> 00:12:57.860
After only spending a few days together,
what could you know?

00:12:57.943 --> 00:13:00.237
Say it. Say you'll come back to Central.

00:13:00.321 --> 00:13:02.531
Why would I ever go back to that place?

00:13:03.115 --> 00:13:06.035
Say it. I'll let you live if you say it.

00:13:06.785 --> 00:13:09.830
My choice is to live with Fine!

00:13:19.048 --> 00:13:21.509
Do it. Kill me, you monster.

00:13:22.009 --> 00:13:24.345
Kill me and prove it.

00:13:25.179 --> 00:13:28.807
Prove that you vampires are savage beasts!

00:13:30.684 --> 00:13:32.770
Hurry up and do it.

00:14:03.342 --> 00:14:04.301
Why?

00:14:12.434 --> 00:14:13.852
Now do you understand?

00:14:15.104 --> 00:14:17.731
It's time to get back to the city.

00:16:55.764 --> 00:16:59.101
Momo. I'm glad.

00:17:00.644 --> 00:17:03.731
We did it. We got away.

00:17:06.358 --> 00:17:07.860
Yeah. We did it.

00:17:11.363 --> 00:17:13.949
Fine, take my blood.

00:17:15.826 --> 00:17:17.536
I'm sorry, Momo.

00:17:18.495 --> 00:17:22.332
At this point
there's nothing that can be done.

00:17:29.923 --> 00:17:32.342
This smell brings back memories.

00:17:35.679 --> 00:17:37.556
The moon azaleas.

00:17:41.185 --> 00:17:45.022
There was once a person I loved.

00:17:51.111 --> 00:17:52.571
<i>That person</i>

00:17:53.405 --> 00:17:55.282
<i>didn't reject or resent me.</i>

00:17:55.991 --> 00:17:58.786
<i>Me, a vampire.</i>

00:18:04.917 --> 00:18:07.961
Vampires and humans together? It can't be.

00:18:08.504 --> 00:18:11.090
What do you mean?
We're together as we speak.

00:18:12.174 --> 00:18:14.718
Come on.
Grab those brushes and come help me.

00:18:18.555 --> 00:18:22.101
<i>She painted and danced.</i>

00:18:22.184 --> 00:18:25.437
<i>And taught me how to make music.</i>

00:18:27.064 --> 00:18:29.733
<i>She taught me the names of flowers.</i>

00:18:42.246 --> 00:18:44.748
<i>What we shared was forbidden,</i>
<i>so people came after us.</i>

00:18:45.791 --> 00:18:47.709
<i>No matter where we went.</i>

00:18:48.252 --> 00:18:50.587
<i>Vampires and humans alike.</i>

00:18:51.797 --> 00:18:54.007
<i>In the end, I couldn't protect her.</i>

00:18:57.636 --> 00:18:59.304
<i>It was all my fault.</i>

00:19:02.182 --> 00:19:03.976
<i>From that day on,</i>

00:19:04.893 --> 00:19:07.479
<i>I lived as if I were already dead.</i>

00:19:10.774 --> 00:19:11.650
<i>Momo…</i>

00:19:12.526 --> 00:19:14.444
Then I met you.

00:19:16.655 --> 00:19:18.157
I know I'm selfish.

00:19:19.366 --> 00:19:21.493
<i>At first, you were her replacement.</i>

00:19:22.244 --> 00:19:26.206
<i>Of her looks and her voice.</i>

00:19:27.374 --> 00:19:30.210
<i>I thought I could leave it at that.</i>

00:19:32.254 --> 00:19:33.255
But…

00:19:39.636 --> 00:19:41.972
you were fierce.

00:19:42.723 --> 00:19:45.392
<i>Far stronger than you think you are.</i>

00:19:47.603 --> 00:19:49.396
Stronger than me.

00:19:50.105 --> 00:19:51.607
Immensely more.

00:19:55.277 --> 00:19:58.030
And you've got a talent for singing.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:04.036
If I'd never met you,
I'd still be in that town.

00:20:04.119 --> 00:20:06.038
I would never have heard music.

00:20:06.747 --> 00:20:10.042
You taught me everything, Fine.

00:20:12.127 --> 00:20:15.005
Well, I don't know about that.

00:20:15.964 --> 00:20:18.091
Besides, I'm tone-deaf.

00:20:19.426 --> 00:20:20.469
Momo…

00:20:21.345 --> 00:20:24.932
Please, sing for me.

00:20:25.891 --> 00:20:27.392
I can't, Fine.

00:20:28.185 --> 00:20:29.478
I can't do that.

00:20:30.187 --> 00:20:33.023
You saved me.

00:20:34.149 --> 00:20:37.694
Don't let me live in darkness any longer.

00:20:38.403 --> 00:20:40.572
Fine… No…

00:20:42.658 --> 00:20:44.076
Please.

00:20:44.743 --> 00:20:46.828
Let me live

00:20:48.455 --> 00:20:50.082
in your happy memories.

00:21:38.213 --> 00:21:40.924
Momo, I'm sorry.

00:21:41.508 --> 00:21:43.427
I brought this upon you.

00:21:43.927 --> 00:21:46.221
-But--
-It was just like you said.

00:21:46.763 --> 00:21:52.144
I was a girl that knew
nothing about the world.

00:21:53.228 --> 00:21:57.357
You had helped me through everything,
but I was so selfish.

00:21:57.899 --> 00:21:59.234
Wait, Momo.

00:21:59.318 --> 00:22:02.154
Tell me, is this how
you wanted it to turn out?

00:22:02.237 --> 00:22:04.573
This desolate land,
is what you were searching for?

00:22:05.198 --> 00:22:06.366
Momo!

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:07.868
Come back here, Momo.

00:22:10.162 --> 00:22:13.665
I forbid you.
What makes you think you can run away?

00:22:13.749 --> 00:22:15.375
I will not allow it.

00:22:16.335 --> 00:22:17.878
Thank you for everything.

00:22:19.212 --> 00:22:23.091
Let's lead our own lives from now on.

00:22:23.884 --> 00:22:26.011
You'll live yours and I'll live mine.

00:22:26.887 --> 00:22:27.804
Be well.

00:22:30.724 --> 00:22:32.017
Momo!

00:22:33.143 --> 00:22:35.604
Wait, Momo!

00:25:18.934 --> 00:25:20.268
<i>It was you.</i>

00:25:20.352 --> 00:25:24.189
<i>You wished to free yourself</i>
<i>from that city, on that day.</i>

00:25:25.148 --> 00:25:28.735
<i>You chose to live and you took my hand.</i>

00:25:28.818 --> 00:25:32.822
Subtitle translation by: Angie Yaeyama
